    <x:String x:Key="WorkflowTitle">How it works</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="WorkflowStep1">Export the images (one by one or as one big image) into the work folder.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="WorkflowStep2">Edit the PNG files with an image editor of your choice.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="WorkflowStep3">Import the edited images – the preview shows the result.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="WorkflowStep4">Save the file to your UCP mod (tool bar, on the right) – the game files are not overwritten. You can remove the file from the mod again at any time.</x:String>
